Package: book-publish-forge
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk
Recommends: ollama
Maintainer: Book Publish Forge Team <noreply@example.com>
Description: Book Publish Forge — AI writing studio for Linux
 A modular desktop writing suite that integrates with local LLM tools
 (Ollama) and cover-art generators (Stable Diffusion WebUI).
 .
 Features include a chapter/scene binder, AI writing assistant, word-count
 goal tracking, focus mode, content-mode detection, ethics review, and
 multi-format manuscript export (.txt, .md, .html).
